he book for reference and that is copy righted material. Still a few bugs to work out such as when a spell is listed in the rote section and you cast it as an improvised spell it still gives to the free reaches as if it was a Rote. but that is minor.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i855.photobucket.com/albums/ab116/cdjensen99/Capture_1.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 05-31-2017, 05:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T05:12:25-07:00","id":1098731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1057208-mage-2e-character-creator?p=1098706#post1098706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do that in a spreadsheet. I would share it but I have also placed all of the spell information from the book for reference and that is copy righted material. Still a few bugs to work out such as when a spell is listed in the rote section and you cast it as an improvised spell it still gives to the free reaches as if it was a Rote. but that is minor.<br /> <br /> <br /